<title>BELGIUM: Tractebel takes 49 pct stake in Thai firm.</title>
<headline>Tractebel takes 49 pct stake in Thai firm.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian utility group Tractebel has taken a 49 percent stake in Thai engineering firm PRO-EN Ltd, Tractebel said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Bangkok-based PRO-EN is an engineering and consulting bureau employing some 100 staff who work on projects in the construction, road infrastructure, water management and environmental sectors, the statement added.</p>
<p>With Tractebel's backing, PRO-EN intends to extend its business into power generation, transmission and into industry, moves which the company said would allow it to reinforce its existing investments in Thailand.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710 (PIC)</p>
